<p>A <code>GET</code> endpoint that retrieves all messages associated with a specific session ID. It extracts the session ID from the request URL and queries the <code>messages</code> table, returning the results as a JSON response. If the session ID is not provided, it returns an empty array.</p>
</li>
</ul>
