<p>The repository is now ready to deploy to Vercel. Use the following steps to deploy:</p>
<ul>
<li>Start by creating a GitHub repository containing your app&#x27;s code.</li>
<li>Then, navigate to the Vercel Dashboard and create a <strong>New Project</strong>.</li>
<li>Link the new project to the GitHub repository you&#x27;ve just created.</li>
<li>In <strong>Settings</strong>, update the <strong>Environment Variables</strong> to match those in your local <code>.env</code> file.</li>
<li>Deploy.</li>
</ul>
